  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Vehicle
  instruments: 1
  instrumentReference: 9
  instrumentReferenceNotes: 'Generic 12-tube 6x6 rocket-artillery prototype; the POLYGON mesh is not a confirmed real vehicle. HIMARS-like driver instruments remain an approximate reference, not exact identification. HIMARS carries one six-rocket pod; the modeled twelve exposed tubes do not match it. GMLRS uses GPS-aided inertial coordinate guidance, not an aircraft-style seeker lock. This arena prototype retains unguided ballistic HE rockets and does not claim coordinate-guided GMLRS capability. References: https://www.lockheedmartin.com/en-us/products/himars.html ; https://news.lockheedmartin.com/2023-04-27-us-army-awards-production-contract-for-all-weather-gmlrs-rocket'
